    "name": "Tomatillo Salsa",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">This green sauce is made from organic, Northwest tomatillos and Anaheim peppers. Its creamy texture and flavor make it a truly versatile sauce. Smother chicken in it, make enchiladas, use it on rice, or in chili verde as the base. It is sure to make your mouth water and be a culinary pleasure for the whole crew.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients: Organic Tomatillo's, Organic Onions, Organic Jalapeno's Peppers, Organic Cilantro, Organic Apple Cider Vinegar, Sea Salt, Organic Garlic, Organic Cumin, Organic Chili Powder, Xanthan Gum.</span></p>",
